#55105
Chapter One - The Faerie Realm~
   Faerie can reveal itself, bright and glittering without warning, anywhere
and just as suddenly disappear.  Its frontiers of twilight, mists and fancy are
all around us and, like a tide running out, can momentarily reveal Faerie
before flowing back to conceal it again.    
~
