#55106
Chapter One - The Faerie Realm~
   The inhbitants of faerieland can be divided into various different species
according to habitat.  In addition to the solitary-living faeries, there are
many rural elf types who make their homes in forests, or sometimes more
specifically, adopt a tree to such an extent that the tree and the faerie
become more or less synonymous.  They also find hills, fields, and mountain
caves.    
~
