#55166
Chapter Two - Hollow Hill~
   In folklore, they say that those who can see the faeries are blessed with
second sight.  Where some people perceive only empty fields, a man or woman
with second sight can see a host of faeries dancing in a ring or the shining
entrance to a faerie hill.    
~
