Evil Faeries~
  The faeries take great umbrage at interruptions, and interference. 
There are many accounts of men and women punished for interrupting 
faerie revels, chopping down faerie bushes and trees, or otherwise 
giving offense. 
  Like any supernatural encounter, meeting a faerie, even one that is 
gentle and benign, is never a comfortable experience. But to meet one 
of the dark creatures from the shadowed depths of the faerie Otherworld 
can be frightening indeed. As you travel into the faeries domain, it is 
best to he wary of things unseen and of the music lures you into the woods. 
And always treat faeries with courtesy. You don't want to make them angry.
