the early hours or mysterious midnight mewings.  Traditionally he is heard
inside cupboards and bedrooms, and always on the other side of doors.  This is
the faerie to blame when you keys are left inside a locked car or hotel room.
He is a creature who needs a lot attention, for his feelings are easily
ruffled.  But if you make the effort to get him on your side he will act in
your best interest and then you will always be in the right place at the right
time.    
